# Mutable state reachable from published graph facts.
# Format: ROOT CARRIER PRIMITIVE  # witness path. ROOT is a type read or
# published as a graph fact. CARRIER is a type reachable from ROOT through
# fields, aliases or generic arguments that directly holds PRIMITIVE.
# Shrink-only forever: removing a line is progress, adding one requires
# explicit user approval. See GRAPH-INTEGRITY.md. Shrink after removal:
# GRAPH_INTEGRITY_SHRINK=1 justrust test --test graph_integrity
